WEBVTT

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:07.411
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:00:08.181 --> 00:00:15.241
Did you know that when you think
about it, you know little about yourself?

00:00:17.621 --> 00:00:21.061
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:21.161 --> 00:00:26.221
When you're about
to give up all hope, look at the sky...

00:00:27.631 --> 00:00:33.121
...because the wind
will gently dry all your tears.

00:00:34.301 --> 00:00:37.101
And then the light
that floods down...

00:00:37.441 --> 00:00:44.071
...from the big stars in the sky will come
down and gently wrap all around you.

00:00:47.381 --> 00:00:52.181
A magical jewel...
Everything you want...

00:00:52.351 --> 00:00:59.421
...is in a haze much thicker
than any dream you have had.

00:00:59.631 --> 00:01:05.661
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:01:06.671 --> 00:01:11.631
I have my faith that what I feel is all true.

00:01:12.611 --> 00:01:19.041
Breaking through the wall of steel,
I can now see on the other side.

00:01:19.721 --> 00:01:26.991
The sea that opens to tomorrow,
and it will be shining for me.

00:01:42.241 --> 00:01:44.871
That crown chooses its owner.

00:01:44.971 --> 00:01:45.911
Chooses?

00:01:46.241 --> 00:01:51.441
That crown can only be touched by
one worthy of being Cephiro's Pillar.

00:01:54.121 --> 00:01:59.051
Only those with the strength of
heart to support Cephiro can wear it.

00:01:59.521 --> 00:02:01.581
It is a living magic circlet.

00:02:02.521 --> 00:02:06.151
I'm against it! You can't
go alone. Absolutely not!

00:02:06.261 --> 00:02:08.821
I am against the idea as well.

00:02:09.031 --> 00:02:13.491
Me too. It's too dangerous for you
to go outside the castle by yourself.

00:02:13.601 --> 00:02:17.331
But there's no one in this castle
who can become the Pillar, right?

00:02:17.441 --> 00:02:20.071
Then someone might
be outside the castle!

00:02:20.181 --> 00:02:24.741
But still, it's too dangerous to go
by yourself! I'm against it too!

00:02:24.851 --> 00:02:26.441
I'll go with you.

00:02:26.551 --> 00:02:27.911
You can't.

00:02:28.021 --> 00:02:31.251
Two Magic Knights
shouldn't leave the castle.

00:02:32.021 --> 00:02:36.861
What would happen if the battleships
from Autozam or Fahren attack again?

00:02:36.961 --> 00:02:41.221
Then it would be a larger problem
to not have all three in one place.

00:02:42.331 --> 00:02:45.771
It'll be fine. I'm sure I can
tell if a battleship comes.

00:02:45.871 --> 00:02:48.031
I'll call my Rune-God and rush back.

00:02:48.171 --> 00:02:52.331
And it could be someone
might still be left out there.

00:02:52.941 --> 00:02:55.601
Just like that woman
Lantis brought back.

00:02:58.611 --> 00:02:59.641
I know!

00:02:59.751 --> 00:03:02.551
I'll ask Lantis if he'll come with me!

00:03:07.361 --> 00:03:10.811
Your hatred amuses me.

00:03:12.361 --> 00:03:14.161
People's hatred...

00:03:14.261 --> 00:03:15.521
Their pain...

00:03:15.901 --> 00:03:17.491
...is my joy.

00:03:17.771 --> 00:03:19.101
My power.

00:03:19.871 --> 00:03:23.101
You will be of good
use to me, Alcyone.

00:03:24.811 --> 00:03:26.241
As you wish...

00:03:28.341 --> 00:03:29.741
...Lady Debonair.

00:03:29.851 --> 00:03:35.811
Hikaru and Lantis's Dangerous Journey

00:03:54.741 --> 00:03:56.171
Flame...

00:03:56.771 --> 00:03:58.301
...Arrow!

00:04:08.281 --> 00:04:09.271
Monsters...

00:04:10.051 --> 00:04:13.211
I think they're much
stronger now than before.

00:04:16.421 --> 00:04:20.721
All monsters in Cephiro
are materializations of the heart.

00:04:21.961 --> 00:04:26.761
The fear of people who have lost
their Pillar creates powerful monsters.

00:04:27.671 --> 00:04:28.761
I see...

00:04:29.941 --> 00:04:32.131
Everyone is worried.

00:04:40.281 --> 00:04:41.511
It really...

00:04:43.891 --> 00:04:45.351
...has changed.

00:04:52.331 --> 00:04:54.421
That Cephiro is no longer...

00:05:05.141 --> 00:05:06.071
Huh?

00:05:11.511 --> 00:05:13.171
Hey, Lantis...

00:05:13.981 --> 00:05:17.081
Why'd you tag along
with that short girl?

00:05:17.991 --> 00:05:21.581
She asked you to come
with her outside the castle...

00:05:22.261 --> 00:05:26.521
I thought that only you were weird
enough to do things like that, Lantis!

00:05:32.631 --> 00:05:33.971
You're so slow!

00:05:34.071 --> 00:05:37.471
I wonder if size has something
to do with walking speed!

00:05:37.771 --> 00:05:38.701
Sorry.

00:05:38.811 --> 00:05:41.801
Then again, I'm small, but I can fly...

00:05:41.911 --> 00:05:43.881
So it's a breeze for me!

00:05:48.481 --> 00:05:51.381
Wait, is he, by any chance...

00:05:52.551 --> 00:05:55.821
...walking slowly to match my pace?

00:06:01.461 --> 00:06:03.491
Here we go!

00:06:07.371 --> 00:06:10.631
How is it? My graceful flight...

00:06:16.241 --> 00:06:17.581
W-W-Wait...

00:06:18.081 --> 00:06:20.311
Wait a minute!

00:06:29.121 --> 00:06:30.321
Lantis!

00:06:41.741 --> 00:06:42.861
Lightning...

00:06:43.241 --> 00:06:44.331
...Call!

00:07:04.491 --> 00:07:05.821
Amazing...

00:07:08.061 --> 00:07:09.501
Clef told me.

00:07:10.201 --> 00:07:13.961
That you were the only
magic swordsman in Cephiro.

00:07:16.071 --> 00:07:18.161
That was a long time ago.

00:07:21.181 --> 00:07:25.201
Umi, don't pace around
so much and calm down a bit.

00:07:25.311 --> 00:07:26.941
I am calm.

00:07:27.951 --> 00:07:31.581
Calm people do not pace
around the room like that.

00:07:32.491 --> 00:07:35.511
Oh? I'm not pacing around at all.

00:07:38.431 --> 00:07:40.861
Look at where you are right now.

00:07:42.761 --> 00:07:46.761
My, when did I teleport over here?

00:07:47.241 --> 00:07:49.671
Please sit down over here.

00:07:53.241 --> 00:07:56.701
I am worried about
Ms. Hikaru as well.

00:07:57.711 --> 00:07:58.741
I know.

00:07:59.051 --> 00:08:01.981
But I'm just so worried...

00:08:05.091 --> 00:08:08.921
Say, Clef, what kind
of person is that Lantis guy?

00:08:10.231 --> 00:08:12.921
I would like to know as well.

00:08:14.601 --> 00:08:18.501
I only know Lantis from
when he lived in Cephiro.

00:08:19.431 --> 00:08:23.031
I taught him magic when
I was teaching Zagato.

00:08:23.741 --> 00:08:28.111
I appointed the elder brother, Zagato,
high priest to assist Princess Emeraude.

00:08:28.211 --> 00:08:32.771
I then appointed Lantis, the younger,
guard captain to protect the princess.

00:08:34.181 --> 00:08:36.711
That was a long time ago...

00:08:37.751 --> 00:08:42.621
Then he was guard captain
before Mr. Lafarga?

00:08:43.761 --> 00:08:44.851
Yes.

00:08:45.291 --> 00:08:50.821
Until the day that Lantis
suddenly vanished from Cephiro...

00:09:05.451 --> 00:09:06.411
Rain?

00:09:35.881 --> 00:09:36.971
Oh, um...

00:09:37.381 --> 00:09:38.971
It's all right. I'm fine.

00:09:39.081 --> 00:09:40.671
I'm pretty tough...

00:09:40.781 --> 00:09:43.221
I won't catch a cold or anything.

00:09:50.731 --> 00:09:51.751
Thank you...

00:10:05.011 --> 00:10:07.411
I wonder if a storm is coming.

00:10:07.511 --> 00:10:11.101
Oh, wait, there are
no storms or typhoons here.

00:10:12.181 --> 00:10:14.881
Lantis, you've never seen one, right?

00:10:15.721 --> 00:10:16.811
I have.

00:10:17.321 --> 00:10:19.411
But I thought that in Cephiro...

00:10:19.751 --> 00:10:22.311
When I was traveling in other worlds.

00:10:23.491 --> 00:10:25.361
You were a traveler...

00:10:26.491 --> 00:10:28.761
Was that for a long time?

00:10:31.271 --> 00:10:33.031
You could say that...

00:10:33.531 --> 00:10:34.631
Hey...

00:10:34.801 --> 00:10:38.071
Were you ever
lonely traveling alone?

00:10:46.511 --> 00:10:49.241
Hold it! Hold it! Hold it!

00:10:51.021 --> 00:10:53.821
What's with this mood?

00:10:54.521 --> 00:10:56.051
Lantis is mine!

00:10:56.591 --> 00:10:59.191
Don't put him in any funny situations!

00:11:00.461 --> 00:11:01.691
Funny?

00:11:05.131 --> 00:11:07.001
M-Mokona!

00:11:15.381 --> 00:11:17.281
Y-You tried to e-eat...

00:11:17.851 --> 00:11:19.841
You were trying to eat me!

00:11:19.951 --> 00:11:22.711
You were just gonna
swallow me whole!

00:11:39.471 --> 00:11:44.601
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:46.471 --> 00:11:50.601
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:12:03.861 --> 00:12:04.881
That's...

00:12:04.991 --> 00:12:06.321
Autozam's...

00:12:10.701 --> 00:12:12.291
The FTO.

00:12:14.001 --> 00:12:15.261
Eagle.

00:12:26.581 --> 00:12:28.051
Good afternoon...

00:12:28.581 --> 00:12:30.241
...lady Magic Knight.

00:12:31.751 --> 00:12:33.691
I see you're alone today.

00:12:34.661 --> 00:12:37.121
How do you know that I'm alone?

00:12:38.231 --> 00:12:39.961
The last time we met...

00:12:40.161 --> 00:12:44.031
...I took your biological data
along with your battle data.

00:12:49.801 --> 00:12:53.141
You've helped me
immensely by being here alone.

00:13:08.761 --> 00:13:12.621
Can't you give up on
the Pillar of Cephiro?

00:13:13.261 --> 00:13:14.351
I cannot...

00:13:15.601 --> 00:13:18.591
My country needs the Pillar system.

00:13:31.481 --> 00:13:33.001
Rayearth!

00:13:57.611 --> 00:13:59.541
It truly is amazing.

00:14:02.381 --> 00:14:06.141
I wonder what that
Rune-God uses for mobilization.

00:14:19.291 --> 00:14:20.391
Lantis...

00:14:38.551 --> 00:14:39.671
Go.

00:14:57.801 --> 00:14:58.891
Flame...

00:15:01.601 --> 00:15:02.761
...Arrow!

00:15:04.011 --> 00:15:05.231
Shield.

00:15:13.581 --> 00:15:15.981
What is this? What is this?

00:16:17.211 --> 00:16:20.811
I don't want to hurt
a girl like you any further.

00:16:22.451 --> 00:16:24.481
Will you please cooperate?

00:16:32.861 --> 00:16:34.091
Shield.

00:16:53.281 --> 00:16:54.841
T-The shield...

00:17:00.421 --> 00:17:01.351
What?

00:17:21.141 --> 00:17:25.371
I forgot that one's apparent age
doesn't reflect one's power in Cephiro.

00:17:30.151 --> 00:17:32.881
If I take it easy
thinking she's just a girl...

00:17:32.991 --> 00:17:35.421
...I will be the one to suffer.

00:17:53.841 --> 00:17:54.831
What?

00:17:57.411 --> 00:17:58.571
She's gone...

00:18:29.281 --> 00:18:30.271
What?

00:18:38.451 --> 00:18:39.891
Stop this now!

00:18:41.091 --> 00:18:42.211
Eagle!

00:18:42.761 --> 00:18:43.881
Lantis...

00:18:47.901 --> 00:18:49.331
I told you...

00:18:50.771 --> 00:18:54.131
The Pillar of Cephiro
is by no means almighty.

00:18:55.101 --> 00:18:56.191
Lantis...

00:18:58.011 --> 00:19:02.071
My mission is to seize control
of the Pillar system of Cephiro.

00:19:25.101 --> 00:19:26.431
Wait, Eagle!

00:19:34.781 --> 00:19:37.271
W-What is it this time?

00:19:47.591 --> 00:19:49.521
It's no use fighting.

00:19:50.391 --> 00:19:53.691
Everything in this world
belongs to Lady Debonair.

00:19:54.731 --> 00:19:58.661
You should just sit quietly
and wait for the time of destruction.

00:20:30.031 --> 00:20:33.801
You know something
about that evil aura.

00:20:35.071 --> 00:20:36.261
That voice...

00:20:37.541 --> 00:20:39.301
Who is Debonair?

00:20:41.481 --> 00:20:42.971
Lord Zagato...

00:20:44.141 --> 00:20:46.041
So you knew Zagato.

00:20:48.681 --> 00:20:50.121
Lord Zagato...

00:20:52.691 --> 00:20:54.091
Lord Zagato...

00:20:55.761 --> 00:20:57.751
My dear Lord Zagato...

00:20:58.831 --> 00:21:00.321
I loved you...

00:21:01.601 --> 00:21:05.261
I truly loved you...

00:21:11.111 --> 00:21:12.971
I can't forgive you.

00:21:14.211 --> 00:21:15.701
Arile!

00:21:22.021 --> 00:21:24.451
Everything will disappear!

00:21:34.031 --> 00:21:34.831
Hikaru!

00:21:34.831 --> 00:21:36.091
Hikaru!
Ms. Hikaru!

00:21:36.631 --> 00:21:38.561
What's wrong? Umi! Fuu!

00:21:39.031 --> 00:21:40.431
Hikaru is...

00:21:40.601 --> 00:21:42.691
Ms. Hikaru is in danger.

00:22:17.911 --> 00:22:23.311
You are like the fast wind that blows
across the surface of the ocean.

00:22:23.981 --> 00:22:31.251
And all the dreams you have are always
engulfed in infinite rays of sunlight.

00:22:32.691 --> 00:22:38.251
I don't want to see you with your back
turned to me like you are right now.

00:22:38.961 --> 00:22:42.761
Heading toward the future,
both your wings are broken...

00:22:43.131 --> 00:22:45.501
...yet you hide your pain from me.

00:22:47.331 --> 00:22:50.631
Softly...
Let me wipe all your tears away.

00:22:51.011 --> 00:22:54.341
Softly...
Let me hold you in my embrace.

00:22:54.781 --> 00:23:01.681
Softly... Let me comfort you in my arms
because I want you to be at peace.

00:23:02.121 --> 00:23:05.521
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:05.851 --> 00:23:14.281
Even if you rest your wings now, the
dreams that you see now will not end...

00:23:17.131 --> 00:23:20.461
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:20.701 --> 00:23:28.771
If you have a heart that believes,
I'm sure it will be of help to you...

00:23:30.841 --> 00:23:37.651
I'll give you my love lullaby...

00:23:46.261 --> 00:23:48.521
I'm Hikaru Shidou!

00:23:48.801 --> 00:23:51.961
I woke up in a room
I didn't recognize.

00:23:52.201 --> 00:23:53.461
Where am I?

00:23:53.701 --> 00:23:56.331
I was captured
by that white machine...

00:23:57.041 --> 00:24:00.671
The door suddenly opened,
and a boy I never met stood there.

00:24:00.771 --> 00:24:05.371
And in the room that the boy
led me to was Eagle of Autozam!

00:24:05.911 --> 00:24:07.941
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:08.051 --> 00:24:09.381
Eagle and the Captive Hikaru.

00:24:09.381 --> 00:24:10.621
Eagle and the Captive Hikaru
Eagle and the Captive Hikaru.

00:24:10.621 --> 00:24:12.391
Eagle and the Captive Hikaru
You have to watch it!

00:24:12.391 --> 00:24:13.391
Eagle and the Captive Hikaru

00:24:13.391 --> 00:24:20.261
Who is it today?

00:24:21.161 --> 00:24:23.291
Today, it's Mokona!

00:24:23.401 --> 00:24:29.701
Look forward to the next episode!
